From 9a7cbe50dd95594d6fb3c57b8454ace58d8d8d0a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Yang Xiuwei <yangxiuwei@kylinos.cn>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 15:22:45 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] io_uring/futex: fail soft links when cancelling a wait

__io_futex_cancel() completes the request with -ECANCELED but does
not call req_set_fail(). IOSQE_IO_LINK dependents then still run.

Fixes: 194bb58c6090 ("io_uring: add support for futex wake and wait")
Signed-off-by: Yang Xiuwei <yangxiuwei@kylinos.cn>
Link: https://patch.msgid.link/20261114072246.741950-2-yangxiuwei@kylinos.cn
Signed-off-by: Jens Axboe <axboe@kernel.dk>
---
 io_uring/futex.c | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/io_uring/futex.c b/io_uring/futex.c
index 9e4e63ee7bc1..615eaa9104b1 100644
--- a/io_uring/futex.c
+++ b/io_uring/futex.c
@@ -107,6 +107,7 @@ static bool __io_futex_cancel(struct io_kiocb *req)
 	}
 
 	hlist_del_init(&req->hash_node);
+	req_set_fail(req);
 	io_req_set_res(req, -ECANCELED, 0);
 	io_req_task_work_add(req);
 	return true;
-- 
2.56.1

